\sum_{k=0}^4{\frac{10!}{(10-k)!k!}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{10-k}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^k} = \frac{1}{2^{10}}\sum_{k=0}^4{\frac{10!}{(10-k)!k!}} = \frac{1}{1024}(1 + 10 + 45 + 120 + 210) = \frac{386}{1024} = \frac{193}{512}
\] </think> <answer>$\frac{193}{512}$</answer>

